1
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:18,220
Right-click an account to change its settings.

2
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:28,400
Set Negotiation decides which of the client's orders need your confirmation.

3
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:41,590
The Neg column shows the new setting.

4
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:48,730
Back to the instrument's own setting.

5
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:58,420
Set Default Amount is the client's default trade size, in trade steps or as a share of usable margin.

6
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:14,280
DA shows it.

7
00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:24,270
Set Group gives the account a label for grouping accounts in the grid.

8
00:01:24,370 --> 00:01:32,120
Set Dealer Range sets the price tolerance for this client's orders; the default is the system value.

9
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:37,120
Deactivate Account blocks the client from trading until you activate it again.

